OL,3,GNEWSALennon criticises 'nasty' Scottish
OL,4,ALabour as leadership bid fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonica Lennon has branded Scottish
OL,7,FLabour "quite nasty" and accused it of
OL,8,Fhaving "a problem when it comes to
OL,9,Ftrans people".
OL,11,FThe MSP, a vocal supporter of trans
OL,12,Frights, failed to secure enough
OL,13,Fnominations to join Michael Marra and
OL,14,FJoe Fagan in the contest to replace
OL,15,FAnas Sarwar as party leader.
OL,17,FBoth Marra and Fagan have expressed
OL,18,Fscepticism about recent attempts by the
OL,19,FScottish Parliament to make it easier
OL,20,Ffor an individual to change their
OL,21,Flegally recognised sex.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
