OL,3,GNEWSALennon criticises 'nasty' Scottish
OL,4,ALabour as leadership bid fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FLennon told BBC Scotland News that
OL,7,FScottish Labour - which finished joint
OL,8,Fsecond with Reform in the Holyrood
OL,9,Felection - should be showing compassion
OL,10,Fand respect to trans people.
